  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "資料科學與大數據實務",
    "sub_ename": "DATA SCIENCE AND BIG DATA ANALYTICS",
    "describe_ch": "隨著資訊化與物聯網技術的發展，產生了巨量數據資料。處理、儲存以及如何從大數據資料中探勘有用的知識，為近年來熱門的議題。本課程教授內容包括：1. 大數據處理與儲存 2.大數據分析方法3.大數據實務個案介紹",
    "describe_eh": "With the development of information and IoT technology, huge amounts of data have been generated. How to process, storage and explore useful knowledge from big data has become a hot topic in recent years. The content of this course includes: 1. Big data processing and storage 2. Big data analysis 3. Introduction of big data practical case.",
